    <string name="about_tagline">A modern, native Jetpack Compose Android client for Exploring and Tracking Visual Novels via the VNDB.org API v2 (Kana).</string>
    <string name="about_features_heading">Key Features</string>
    <string name="about_feature_1">• Native Material 3 UI with 11 visual novel inspired color themes</string>
    <string name="about_feature_2">• Full VNDB Kana v2 search with tags, developers, languages, platforms &amp; character traits</string>
    <string name="about_feature_3">• Character Trait Explorer (/kana/trait &amp; /kana/character) with role &amp; sex filters</string>
    <string name="about_feature_4">• Local-first collection management with two-way VNDB cloud synchronization</string>
    <string name="about_feature_5">• Offline collection caching, batch operations, custom status tab order &amp; NSFW cover blur</string>
